 {
  "text": "Good afternoon, shoppers, and welcome to Dolphin Mall. Can I have your attention, please? Today all dresses are twenty percent off. The fitting rooms are on the second floor. The mall is open until nine p.m. Thank you, and happy shopping!",
  "voice": "sarah_us",
  "file": "a7_listening1.mp3"
 },
 {
